,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-491e3381a86a2a9c36f0","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-e466cc235aee33d5b553","layer":"original","quote":"虔引兵与夏侯渊会击之；前后数十战，斩首获生数千人","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":134,"end":158,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-c42fbada334741ed50d9","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-225cd229025c9ed1b3d2","layer":"original","quote":"与夏侯渊讨黄巾余贼徐和等","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":50,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":199,"end":211,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o012c-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-594aafbe9f825ff421de","layer":"original","quote":"济南、乐安黄巾徐和、司马俱等攻城〖5〗，杀长吏。渊将泰山、齐、平原郡兵击〖6〗，大破之；斩和，平诸县，收其粮谷以给军士。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":42,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":124,"end":184,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o012","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-594aafbe9f825ff421de","layer":"original","quote":"太祖起兵，以别部司马、骑都尉从，迁陈留、颍川太守。及与袁绍战于官渡，行督军校尉〖3〗。绍破，使督兖、豫、徐州军粮。时军食少，渊传馈相继〖4〗，军以复振。昌豨反，遣于禁击之，未拔；复遣渊与禁并力。遂击豨，降其十余屯，豨诣禁降。渊还，拜典军校尉。﹝二﹞济南、乐安黄巾徐和、司马俱等攻城〖5〗，杀长吏。渊将泰山、齐、平原郡兵击〖6〗，大破之；斩和，平诸县，收其粮谷以给军士。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":42,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":184,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
